# skills: Gabryel casts on a back-row enemy that stays in the back row (her leap), and the cast with no
# effect step. Gabryel alone at level 30 (level index 29 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple
# battle: back row 4, 5, 6, front row 9, 10, so battlers 5 and 6 have a living enemy in front and stay
# up. Round 1: Venom Claw (Down on the list), grid Right to battler 5, A: she leaps up to it, strikes with
# no damage, the green ring shows (shots br_00 to br_23), MP 50 -> 42, status5 0 -> 6. Round 2: Blinding
# Swipe (Right on the list); battler 4 has dropped to the front, so the grid opens on battler 5 (tag Psn)
# and Right is battler 6; A, and then battler 6 is poisoned in memory before she acts: the cast plays
# the leap with no ring, the message line says "No effect!" (bs_00 to bs_35), MP 50 -> 43 is still
# taken, status6 stays 6.
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18, ATK +0x24, ATK stage +0x40). Run with --save.
include party_gabryel
pin u32 0x020B471C 29
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
